     "text": [
      "SciSciNet atypicality 2x2 (hit = top 5% C10 in FoS x year) -> hit prob per cell: {'LowConv|LowNov': np.float64(0.0294), 'LowConv|HighNov': np.float64(0.0487), 'HighConv|LowNov': np.float64(0.0515), 'HighConv|HighNov': np.float64(0.0677)}\n",
      "CPU times: total: 37.2 s\n",
